      "message": "Thank you for looking into this. Eslint plugin on vscode stopped working for me since eslint update. Currently it sometimes work and sometimes it\u0027s broken.\n\nI spent 1 hour to fix it but I couldn\u0027t find root cause. But it works now sometimes and I can run eslintfix in terminal.",
