      "writtenOn": "2025-05-21T13:33:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, i hadn\u0027t realise that. I only used yarn run lint/eslintfix. Never used VS to do anything.\n\nMake sure the eslint plugin uses eslint-bazel.config.js. Since that has the compatible layer to load the legacy eslint stuff.\n\neslint looks for eslint.config.js now which i used. But i kept all the legacy eslintrc stuff in it and has to be called with eslint-bazel.config.js. It contains compat.config which loads eslint.config.js and is able to translate.\n\nIf you want we can change things up i guess. Move eslint.config.js back to .eslintrc.js i dunno.",
      "parentUuid": "7574c352_4eb09ce9",
      "revId": "157766f260f804beeae37b22dfae70a054089a7a",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
