      "writtenOn": "2025-05-21T13:38:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You probably want to enable eslint.useFlatConfig looking at https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName\u003ddbaeumer.vscode-eslint. But i\u0027ve not used it. Although may be enabled because we use eslint \u003e\u003d9\n\nYou also want to change what config file it loads.\n\n```\n{\n  \"eslint.options\": { \"overrideConfigFile\": \"C:/mydirectory/.eslintrc.json\" }\n}\n```",
      "parentUuid": "3ee01e50_c42b13af",
      "revId": "157766f260f804beeae37b22dfae70a054089a7a",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
